      "rationale": "The simplification asserts the extensional Map fact that deleting fresh key 1 from a map formed by adding that binding restores SC. It is compiled into VERIFICATION before every Stage 1 proof and is never separately proved without the rule present.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-feff944e2f19f17c55e3bc4182bfa0059f8872fc9fa1462060bd73b09293f630",
